{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "『What's\"KAZOKU\"?』"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVが公開されました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/4SdeuouXcWI"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobuyyc8N.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなでベッド挟まれたよ。🛏️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今までにない楽曲で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MV撮影もみんなとわちゃわちゃ楽しい撮影でした！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "不思議な撮影の仕方で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "完成するまでずっとワクワクしてたけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーみんな可愛くて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りのシーンがいっぱいです。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "純葉の穴にはまってからの👍ポーズとか、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "森田さんの虫眼鏡とか、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きらさんのシャッター押すところとか！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんのお気に入りシーンも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ聞かせてね〜。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobo0zKDZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobUzPzkS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おでこ出した！！ﾄﾞｷﾄﾞｷ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メイクさんがこの髪型好きって言ってくれたー。よかった😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな可愛らしいスタイリングで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新鮮だよね〜。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob3SbpoN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "凪ちゃんの髪型わんちゃんみたいで可愛かった！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近犬っぽいなって思う瞬間が多い。🐶"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob0kyGqR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まりのさん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まりのさんとの歌割りお気に入りなの！🍜"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん聞いてみてね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobjLMaCa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moban1Iaz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob3ULQXQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰に撮ってもらったでしょ〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はしゃぎながら撮り合いっこしました📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "制服衣装もパジャマ衣装も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな少しずつ形が違うの！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どっちも可愛いよね☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のブログはここまで〜。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobsRsHBJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobLBQa4t.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobfEkdFp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "💤"}], "source": "official"}